00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,0,8,10,10,80,1Style: OP13-Karaoke,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,10,1Style: OP13-Translation,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: OP13-Kanji,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,110,1Style: OP13-Credits,FOT-Greco Std B,40,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,95,100,1,0,1,2.2,0,1,80,10,100,1Style: Pekoms - Infobox,Roboto,39,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,2,2,10,10,10,1Style: Map,Roboto,39,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,2,2,10,10,10,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 0,0:02:31.20,0:02:38.15,Title,,0,0,230,,A Gift to a New EraDialogue: 0,0:02:41.07,0:02:43.68,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The news has quickly spread around the world.Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.68,0:02:47.98,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The Whitebeard Pirates have failed to rescue Roger’s son, Ace.Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.98,0:02:52.37,Narrator,,0,0,0,,And their legendary captain, Whitebeard, has died.Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.37,0:02:55.42,Main,,0,0,0,,We’re printing a special edition! Get to work!Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.42,0:02:57.56,Main,,0,0,0,,This is an important announcement!Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.56,0:03:01.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Following Fire Fist Ace, we can also confirm the death of Whitebeard!Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.83,0:03:03.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I repeat:Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.54,0:03:05.43,Main,,0,0,0,,At Marineford, Whitebeard has...Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.96,0:03:05.43,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard has...Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.43,0:03:07.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Died!Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.03,0:03:10.37,Main,,0,0,0,,The Whitebeard Pirates are done for, as well!Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.37,0:03:12.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Now the war is over!Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.18,0:03:14.27,Main,,0,0,0,,We can finally live in peace!Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.29,0:03:21.21,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Those who have witnessed this unforgettable historic moment...Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.21,0:03:26.39,Narrator,,0,0,0,,have been left speechless.Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.37,0:03:36.09,Main,,0,0,0,,So you've passed on, Whitebeard.Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.52,0:03:42.58,Main,,0,0,0,,The man who once rivaled...Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.58,0:03:46.54,Main,,0,0,0,,the Pirate King on the high seas...Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.54,0:03:49.16,Main,,0,0,0,,the captain of the Whitebeard Pirates...Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.16,0:03:52.03,Main,,0,0,0,,and the legendary pirate...Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.03,0:03:54.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Edward  "Whitebeard" Newgate....Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.66,0:03:59.63,Main,,0,0,0,,has died at the age of 72 in the fierce battle in Marineford Bay...Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.63,0:04:06.55,Main,,0,0,0,,which broke out between his pirate armada and an alliance of the Navy and the Seven Royal Warlords of the Sea...Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.80,0:04:15.72,Main,,0,0,0,,That damn bastard...Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.72,0:04:19.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Marco. We all feel the same way...Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.64,0:04:22.29,Main,,0,0,0,,but we have to retreat!Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.29,0:04:24.59,Main,,0,0,0,,I know, Vista.Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.17,0:04:28.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there! Get on the ship!Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.43,0:04:30.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you forget our captain's final order?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.14,0:04:35.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe! Hurry and take Ace's brother to safety!Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.26,0:04:36.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course!Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.36,0:04:42.06,Main,,0,0,0,,He sure was one stubborn bastard...Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.06,0:04:43.63,Main,,0,0,0,,So he finally bit the dust?Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.63,0:04:46.81,Main,,0,0,0,,So far, everything has gone exactly according to plan.Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.81,0:04:48.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Well then, Captain...Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.27,0:04:53.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, it's time to begin!Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.20,0:05:02.35,Main,,0,0,0,,They're up to something again!Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.35,0:05:03.45,Main,,0,0,0,,That Teach...Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.45,0:05:05.28,Main,,0,0,0,,What's he planning to do with Pops?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.75,0:05:10.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm about to present...Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.72,0:05:16.49,Main,,0,0,0,,an amazing show that will astonish the entire world!Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.49,0:05:18.94,Main,,0,0,0,,What's with that black shroud?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.94,0:05:21.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Blackbeard and Whitebeard are both underneath it!Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.79,0:05:26.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, I must ask that no one enters for the time being.Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.40,0:05:28.87,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to pull?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.87,0:05:32.21,Main,,0,0,0,,He turned on us after pretending to have joined the Seven Royal Warlords of the Sea!Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.21,0:05:33.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let your guard down!Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.51,0:05:37.12,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to this.Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.12,0:05:40.52,Main,,0,0,0,,If this fails, I suppose we'll have to disband.Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.57,0:05:58.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy, where are you going?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.87,0:06:02.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid or what?! I'm running away, of course!Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.52,0:06:05.24,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way I can take Whitebeard's head now, is there?Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.25,0:06:07.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy...Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.38,0:06:09.00,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I failed!Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.00,0:06:11.72,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I was too scared, and couldn't even approach him!Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.72,0:06:12.60,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I was afraid!Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.60,0:06:17.59,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard... he was scary in his prime, and he's still scary after dying!Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.06,0:06:21.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Just go ahead and think I'm pathetic if you want to!Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.39,0:06:25.33,Main,,0,0,0,,This is where we part ways, you imbeciles!Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.67,0:06:27.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy!Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.87,0:06:30.59,Main,,0,0,0,,He's crying... Captain Buggy!Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.59,0:06:33.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I get it... yesterday's enemies are friends today!Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.17,0:06:38.70,Main,,0,0,0,,At some point, you felt sympathy for your rival Whitebeard as a fellow man!Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.70,0:06:41.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Even though you were going to take his head!Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.41,0:06:44.82,Main,,0,0,0,,And yet you're leaving without trying to make any excuses!Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.60,0:06:47.08,Main,,0,0,0,,You truly are...Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.08,0:06:52.04,Main,,0,0,0,,a man among men, just as we always thought you were!Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.04,0:06:54.36,Main,,0,0,0,,You are too cool, Captain Buggy!Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.36,0:06:56.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Please wait, Captain Buggy!Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.37,0:06:57.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Take us with you!Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.60,0:06:59.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain!Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.59,0:07:06.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry out to sea!Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.49,0:07:09.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-kun...Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.31,0:07:12.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Hang in there... You must survive...Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.42,0:07:15.48,Main,,0,0,0,,in this world that Ace-san has already left behind...Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.48,0:07:17.98,Main,,0,0,0,,on to tomorrow... and the day after...Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.95,0:07:19.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire!Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.05,0:07:25.36,Main,,0,0,0,,You must survive!Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.94,0:07:29.79,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Jinbe... If I end up dying like this...Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.84,0:07:36.23,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I hate to ask, but please take care of my brother...Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.47,0:07:42.40,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I might have to refuse that request, Ace-san...Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.41,0:07:44.45,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You mustn't overestimate me.Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.45,0:07:47.52,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm not that kind-hearted.Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.52,0:07:51.91,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,He might be your brother, but in the world of pirates...Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.91,0:07:57.35,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I will not lend a hand to anyone I don't think highly of, nor will I protect them.Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.35,0:07:59.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe! Come onboard!Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.49,0:08:00.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Sure!Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.79,0:08:02.49,Main,,0,0,0,,This is...Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.63,0:08:09.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn it... The ocean has been frozen!Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.15,0:08:10.60,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't set sail!Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.60,0:08:12.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Quickly, do something about it!Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.64,0:08:14.47,Main,,0,0,0,,It's Admiral Aokiji!Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.47,0:08:16.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Hold Aokiji back!Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.31,0:08:21.98,Main,,0,0,0,,We have no choice... we must take another ship!Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.82,0:08:34.53,Main,,0,0,0,,I said I wouldn't let him escape.Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.53,0:08:38.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Just resign yourself to death, you imbecile!Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.71,0:08:50.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Hand over Dragon’s son!Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.71,0:08:53.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Akainu... isn't dead?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.80,0:08:55.86,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought Pops finished him off!Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.86,0:08:57.34,Main,,0,0,0,,He traveled underground...Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.34,0:08:59.24,Main,,0,0,0,,by melting a path with his magma!Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.24,0:09:01.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.02,0:09:03.69,Main,,0,0,0,,That isn't happening!Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.69,0:09:09.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I have already decided to protect this man, even at the cost of my life!Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.46,0:09:13.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, I will not ask again.Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.24,0:09:21.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Protect Ace's brother!Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.79,0:09:24.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace's family is our family!Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.28,0:09:27.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way, you cowards!Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.68,0:09:29.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Move aside, Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.46,0:09:33.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Emporio Face-Growth HormoneDialogue: 0,0:09:33.95,0:09:38.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Iva-san. Allow me to help as well.Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.53,0:09:42.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Great Scissors!Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.26,0:09:47.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Vi will not let vyou lay one hand on Straw Hat-boy!Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.20,0:09:49.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I will execute Dragon's son!Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.93,0:09:54.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Hell... Wink!Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.99,0:10:03.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Ever since Impel Down...Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.15,0:10:07.78,Main,,0,0,0,,the damage that Straw Hat-boy has taken, both physically and mentally,Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.78,0:10:10.23,Main,,0,0,0,,has long since gone past its limits!Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.88,0:10:17.19,Main,,0,0,0,,If anything else were to happen to Straw Hat-boy now, while Vi'm here...Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.19,0:10:20.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Vi will never be able to show vmy face to vmy comrade, Dragon, again!Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.97,0:10:22.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I feel the same way.Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.04,0:10:26.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.00,0:10:32.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Right now, Vi am burning far, far hotter than vyou are!Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.50,0:10:48.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Well then, ladies and gentlemen...Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.96,0:10:50.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting.Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.92,0:10:54.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain Teach of the Blackbeard Pirates is proud to present...Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.99,0:10:56.97,Main,,0,0,0,,the world's greatest show.Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.97,0:11:00.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Please watch closely!Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.84,0:11:06.38,Main,,0,0,0,,B-Blackbeard!Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.01,0:11:12.35,Main,,0,0,0,,What was he doing in there?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.77,0:11:14.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard hasn't changed at all!Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.33,0:11:19.29,Main,,0,0,0,,And Blackbeard is unchanged too!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.76,0:11:23.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Navy!Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.71,0:11:28.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Allow me to show you my power!Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.07,0:11:32.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, we are enemies once more.Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.14,0:11:39.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Black Hole!Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.28,0:11:42.88,Main,,0,0,0,,What's this?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.58,0:11:53.00,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the power of my Dark-Dark Fruit!Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.00,0:11:54.23,Main,,0,0,0,,And...Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.43,0:11:59.23,Main,,0,0,0,,this is...Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.79,0:12:04.07,Main,,0,0,0,,That stance!Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.64,0:12:31.66,Main,,0,0,0,,That's...Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.49,0:12:34.63,Main,,0,0,0,,the power of the Quake-Quake Fruit!Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.33,0:12:40.44,Main,,0,0,0,,H-How did he use Whitebeard’s power?! He’s dead!Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.45,0:12:47.35,Main,,0,0,0,,You did it, Captain!Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.35,0:12:50.15,Main,,0,0,0,,That’s Pops’ earthquake power!Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.15,0:12:53.05,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?! Damn that Teach!Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.67,0:12:59.00,Main,,0,0,0,,The pull of darkness reverts all to nothing...Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.00,0:13:02.82,Main,,0,0,0,,while the force of earthquakes destroys everything.Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.82,0:13:08.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I've obtained it at last! Now, nobody is a match for me!Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.00,0:13:11.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I am the strongest!Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.41,0:13:16.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know what he did...Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.80,0:13:19.55,Main,,0,0,0,,but he's stolen Whitebeard's power!Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.55,0:13:21.31,Main,,0,0,0,,How can that be possible?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.31,0:13:24.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, the terror of the Quake-Quake Fruit...Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.96,0:13:26.71,Main,,0,0,0,,still hasn't ended?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.71,0:13:32.32,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought it was impossible to have the powers of two Devil Fruits!Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.32,0:13:35.45,Main,,0,0,0,,It's definitely impossible for ordinary humans...Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.45,0:13:39.56,Main,,0,0,0,,but... as you all know, Teach isn't quite normal.Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.56,0:13:44.64,Main,,0,0,0,,His body is fundamentally different from an ordinary person's!Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.64,0:13:47.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that what led to this?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.27,0:13:50.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you all see that?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.21,0:13:54.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Let the whole world know this!Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.76,0:13:57.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Peace-loving, boring commoners!Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.41,0:14:01.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Marines! World Government! And pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.44,0:14:03.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this some nightmare?Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.79,0:14:07.16,Main,,0,0,0,,The future of this world has been decided!Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.46,0:14:12.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, from now on...Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.03,0:14:13.90,Main,,0,0,0,,this is my era!Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.73,0:14:22.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Navy HQ is crumbling to pieces!Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.48,0:14:29.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.69,0:14:32.22,Main,,0,0,0,,It's hopeless!Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.45,0:14:38.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this... real?Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.55,0:14:44.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Someone... please tell me this isn't true!Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.28,0:14:48.29,Main,,0,0,0,,The fortress of justice, the Navy's base,Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.29,0:14:52.83,Main,,0,0,0,,which has protected the oceans of the world for centuries...Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.83,0:14:55.59,Main,,0,0,0,,How could it end up like this?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.86,0:15:07.36,Main,,0,0,0,,After capturing Fire Fist Ace to trigger this war...Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.36,0:15:10.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Blackbeard has stolen Whitebeard’s powers!Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.21,0:15:13.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Behold, all you people of the world!Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.69,0:15:17.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Look at me, and my power!Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.73,0:15:24.93,Main,,0,0,0,,What will happen to the world?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.61,0:15:34.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I can feel the power...Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.66,0:15:38.73,Main,,0,0,0,,surging through me!Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.36,0:15:40.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn it...Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.38,0:15:43.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Such incredible power!Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.00,0:15:46.18,Main,,0,0,0,,It appears that the world’s my oyster!Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.18,0:15:47.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn him!Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.66,0:15:54.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! What's wrong?Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.49,0:15:59.80,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Isn't anyone coming?Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.80,0:16:03.28,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm willing to fight as many of you as you like, too...Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.28,0:16:05.91,Main,,0,0,0,,What a shame!Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.00,0:16:09.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Guess there's no helping it.Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.28,0:16:13.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, first of all...Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.46,0:16:17.39,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll send Marineford to the bottom of the ocean!Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.65,0:16:20.12,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.65,0:16:41.95,Main,,0,0,0,,A shockwave?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.76,0:16:58.17,Main,,0,0,0,,We can just rebuild the fortress!Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.85,0:17:03.62,Main,,0,0,0,,However...Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.62,0:17:08.43,Main,,0,0,0,,this is the island at the very center of the world: Marineford!Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.72,0:17:11.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Fleet Admiral...Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.41,0:17:17.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Our presence here is significant to the citizens of the world...Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.27,0:17:22.45,Main,,0,0,0,,who fear the villains infesting our waters!Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.00,0:17:27.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Justice in the name of humanity shall not fall.Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.70,0:17:32.50,Main,,0,0,0,,You will not so lightly speak of sinking this place.Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.50,0:17:34.29,Main,,0,0,0,,You callow child!Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.39,0:17:45.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Such admirable conviction!Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.92,0:17:48.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Fleet Admiral-san?Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.21,0:17:50.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Well then... listen!Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.74,0:17:53.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Just try to protect it!Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.36,0:18:08.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn it!Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.87,0:18:12.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Now's vyour chance! Hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.70,0:18:15.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Get Straw Hat-boy to safety!Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.76,0:18:18.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Forgive me!Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.57,0:18:22.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Inazuma!Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.63,0:18:38.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Iva-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.28,0:18:45.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Pirate scum!Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.54,0:18:47.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Akainu!Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.57,0:18:51.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe! Give up Dragon’s son!Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.74,0:18:57.88,Main,,0,0,0,,The sea is my turf!Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.88,0:18:59.25,Main,,0,0,0,,We can still escape!Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.00,0:19:09.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! It's frozen?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.72,0:19:12.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Aokiji!Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.97,0:19:16.71,Main,,0,0,0,,So you've come...Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.57,0:19:23.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like you've lost your escape route!Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.11,0:19:30.81,Main,,0,0,0,,It didn't work...Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.81,0:19:33.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.89,0:19:37.56,Main,,0,0,0,,You're mine!Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.10,0:19:49.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.35,0:19:58.60,Main,,0,0,0,,He pierced straight through Jinbe and hit Ace's brother!Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.60,0:20:00.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Is he still alive?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.53,0:20:08.75,Main,,0,0,0,,You’re in my way, Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.02,0:20:15.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-kun... forgive me...Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.48,0:20:18.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I let you get injured again...Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.90,0:20:22.31,Main,,0,0,0,,This is no time to worry about others, you scum!Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.59,0:20:28.49,Main,,0,0,0,,My aim was a little off because you interfered...Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.49,0:20:32.11,Main,,0,0,0,,It would've been easier for him if I pierced his heart.Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.50,0:20:34.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you think so, Jinbe?Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.25,0:20:45.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you still trying to protect him, with that hole in your chest?Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.14,0:20:53.05,Main,,0,0,0,,You'll both die soon enough.Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.16,0:21:10.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Crocodile!Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.55,0:21:12.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Sables!Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.29,0:21:22.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Someone catch him, and get him on a ship already!Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.57,0:21:23.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Right...Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.65,0:21:25.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Crocodile!Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.57,0:21:29.19,Main,,0,0,0,,If you want to protect something, then you should do it right!Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.19,0:21:33.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let these guys keep doing whatever they want!Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.26,0:21:35.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Catch him!Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.41,0:21:39.28,Main,,0,0,0,,It's all over...Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.28,0:21:42.59,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry for getting carried away, everyone.Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.59,0:21:45.55,Main,,0,0,0,,The legend of Captain Buggy is over.Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.55,0:21:48.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you for supporting me.Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.52,0:21:49.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.35,0:21:59.02,Main,,0,0,0,,He's not falling back down...Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.29,0:22:01.91,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.91,0:22:03.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy!Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.86,0:22:07.36,Main,,0,0,0,,You saved Straw Hat and Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.36,0:22:09.41,Main,,0,0,0,,I knew it...Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.72,0:22:14.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy... you just made it look like you were running away,Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.17,0:22:18.85,Main,,0,0,0,,so that you could save your fellow escapee, Straw Hat, in his time of need!Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.04,0:22:22.10,Main,,0,0,0,,How noble!Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.10,0:22:24.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Your nobility is blinding me!Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.59,0:22:28.39,Main,,0,0,0,,They're acting weird again...Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.22,0:22:32.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe and Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.46,0:22:38.93,Main,,0,0,0,,How the hell did you end up flying through the air, covered in blood?Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.93,0:22:40.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, it sure is hot here...Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.00,0:22:45.78,Main,,0,0,0,,M-Magma!Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.78,0:22:51.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Red Nose...Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.36,0:22:52.58,Main,,0,0,0,,You saved us.Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.58,0:22:57.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Still, I let Luffy-kun get another grave injury...Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.81,0:22:59.93,Main,,0,0,0,,We must treat his wounds immediately!Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.93,0:23:03.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up! I'm the one who needs help, you dumbass!Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.81,0:23:06.20,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not like we can treat him up here...Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.81,0:23:08.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Who're you calling Red Nose?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.87,0:23:12.27,Main,,0,0,0,,They get in my way even to the very end!Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.27,0:23:14.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Rose Rondo!Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.18,0:23:24.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Another pack of vermin...Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.25,0:23:28.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you all wish to die for Straw Hat's sake?Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.71,0:23:35.63,Main,,0,0,0,,We've all seen his bottomless tenacity and power.Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.63,0:23:40.12,Main,,0,0,0,,He's the man Ace protected, and Pops respected him!Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.12,0:23:44.16,Main,,0,0,0,,It is our duty to send him on to the new era!Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.16,0:23:48.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Every last one of you are fools!Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.52,0:23:58.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard Pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.42,0:24:00.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Akainu.Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.78,0:24:05.32,Main,,0,0,0,,The terrible danger you see in the one you want to kill...Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.32,0:24:10.15,Main,,0,0,0,,the immense potential we see in the one we want to save...Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.15,0:24:12.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Ain't they one and the same?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.64,0:24:16.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you got me involved again!Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.54,0:24:19.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you listening to me?Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.00,0:24:20.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, J-Jinbe?Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.16,0:24:25.18,Main,,0,0,0,,You're unconscious?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.18,0:24:28.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, where should I go now?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.05,0:24:29.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.68,0:24:34.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Alive or dead, that bastard’s in hell.Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.35,0:24:38.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Just leave him to suffer!Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.47,0:24:43.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess nothing I say will stop you at this point.Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.00,0:24:46.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Do your worst!Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.16,0:25:01.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I-It's hopeless...Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.81,0:25:05.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Sengoku and Blackbeard are over there...Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.37,0:25:15.12,Main,,0,0,0,,And Akainu and the commanders are over there...Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.17,0:25:25.14,Main,,0,0,0,,The battle will never end!Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.14,0:25:28.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy! Do something!Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.27,0:25:30.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Like hell, you idiots!Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.25,0:25:40.93,Main,,0,0,0,,What the...Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.93,0:25:43.09,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a ship!Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.09,0:25:45.46,Main,,0,0,0,,That's a submarine!Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.46,0:25:47.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Whose ship is that?Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.19,0:25:51.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Bring Straw Hatter over here!Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.00,0:25:57.63,Main,,0,0,0,,"Straw Hatter"? That sure is a weird way to address a guy...Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.64,0:25:59.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Who are you, kid?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.35,0:26:02.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hatter and I will probably be enemies someday...Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.82,0:26:04.14,Main,,0,0,0,,but I have nothing against him.Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.80,0:26:07.60,Main,,0,0,0,,It'd be no fun to let him die here.Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.70,0:26:12.42,Captions,,0,0,250,,Captain of the Heart PiratesDialogue: 0,0:26:07.70,0:26:12.42,Captions,,0,0,20,,Trafalgar LawDialogue: 0,0:26:08.19,0:26:12.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll get him out of here. Hand him over!Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.42,0:26:13.94,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.20,0:26:23.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm a doctor!Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.37,0:00:30.41,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing SewilDialogue: 0,0:00:30.41,0:00:36.22,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Quality Control Grug PepperjackDialogue: 0,0:00:36.22,0:00:41.19,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Timing Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.19,0:00:46.93,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Translation YibisDialogue: 0,0:00:46.93,0:00:52.36,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Visual Effects Datenshi KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:00:52.36,0:00:57.44,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Graphics DatenshiDialogue: 0,0:00:57.44,0:01:03.08,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Karaoke KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:01:03.08,0:01:06.56,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Soundtracking HaleeDialogue: 0,0:01:06.56,0:01:08.68,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Raws NetflixComment: 0,0:00:25.37,0:00:30.62,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Every time I look up to the sky after the rainComment: 0,0:00:30.62,0:00:36.13,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,I think back to when I was a crybabyComment: 0,0:00:36.13,0:00:43.87,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,I was chasing somebody's back blindlyComment: 0,0:00:43.94,0:00:46.85,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Thinking "I want to be stronger"Comment: 0,0:00:46.85,0:00:52.03,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,The word "thank you" has faded into the wind nowComment: 0,0:00:52.20,0:00:57.21,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Am I getting stronger?Comment: 0,0:00:57.41,0:01:02.88,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,I don't know the answer yetComment: 0,0:01:03.01,0:01:08.40,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,That's why I'll keep walking aheadComment: 0,0:01:08.55,0:01:11.03,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,So let's goComment: 0,0:01:11.03,0:01:14.24,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Without stoppingComment: 0,0:01:14.24,0:01:19.48,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Without giving up to the flow of timeComment: 0,0:01:19.48,0:01:25.09,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,I'll keep getting back upComment: 0,0:01:25.10,0:01:30.73,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Because I don't want to lose something preciousComment: 0,0:01:30.74,0:01:35.85,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,The voice inside of meComment: 0,0:01:35.86,0:01:41.25,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,keeps sustaining meComment: 0,0:01:41.25,0:01:46.38,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Wicked rain will get in my wayComment: 0,0:01:46.39,0:01:51.32,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,But I won't walk awayComment: 0,0:01:54.42,0:01:56.78,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,So let's goComment: 0,0:01:56.78,0:02:00.06,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Without stoppingComment: 0,0:02:00.06,0:02:05.35,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Without giving up to the flow of timeComment: 0,0:02:05.36,0:02:10.99,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,I'll keep getting back upComment: 0,0:02:10.99,0:02:16.35,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Because I don't want to lose something preciousComment: 0,0:02:16.36,0:02:22.05,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,To the future I believe in...